<title>UK: Ex Whitbread CE to be Burton chairman.</title>
<headline>Ex Whitbread CE to be Burton chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailing group Burton Group Plc said on Friday its chairman John Hoskyns would retire in January 1998 and will be succeeded by Peter Jarvis, a former chief executive of Whitbread Plc.  </p>
<p>Jarvis has been a non-executive director of the group since June 1992.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
